{%- comment -%}
What the chatbot's worker cannot otherwise know about the Now section: which
books are being read. The other channels come from APIs keyed on accounts the
worker already holds; the reading list exists only in _config.yml, and the
browser is what normally hands it to /books. Published here so _config.yml
stays the one place it is edited. Read by worker/src/index.ts (nowNotes).
